            <ArticleTitle>A comparative clinical trial of diflunisal and ibuprofen in the control of pain in osteoarthritis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>272-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A randomized double-blind study in ambulatory patients with osteoarthritis of hip and/or knee was conducted, comparing the efficacy and safety of diflunisal 500 mg daily with ibuprofen 1200 mg daily, and a period of 8 weeks. Thirty-five patients participated in the study. The results revealed no significant differences between the treatment groups with regard to the efficacy parameters.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
